From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Moonlight XR Native <noreply@example.invalid>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 22:49:37 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Name and icon: Moonlight XR for Frame

The window title and display name read Moonlight XR for Frame, and the window icon is the
Moonlight XR logo (res/moonlight-xr.png, copied in by launcher/build.sh from assets/branding).
The profile, config and cache names stay Moonlight XR Native.
---
 app/main.cpp      | 4 ++--
 app/resources.qrc | 1 +
 2 files changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/app/main.cpp b/app/main.cpp
index 8d32821..ca6f711 100644
--- a/app/main.cpp
+++ b/app/main.cpp
@@ -681,11 +681,11 @@ int main(int argc, char *argv[])
 #ifndef Q_OS_DARWIN
     // Set the window icon except on macOS where we want to keep the
     // modified macOS 11 style rounded corner icon.
-    app.setWindowIcon(QIcon(":/res/moonlight.svg"));
+    app.setWindowIcon(QIcon(":/res/moonlight-xr.png"));
 #endif
 
     // This is necessary to show our icon correctly on Wayland
-    app.setApplicationDisplayName("Moonlight XR Native");
+    app.setApplicationDisplayName("Moonlight XR for Frame");
     app.setDesktopFileName("moonlight-xr-launcher");
     qputenv("SDL_VIDEO_WAYLAND_WMCLASS", "moonlight-xr-launcher");
     qputenv("SDL_VIDEO_X11_WMCLASS", "moonlight-xr-launcher");
diff --git a/app/resources.qrc b/app/resources.qrc
index 493d0e9..a2e8a5d 100644
--- a/app/resources.qrc
+++ b/app/resources.qrc
@@ -13,6 +13,7 @@
         <file>res/arrow_left.svg</file>
         <file>res/question_mark.svg</file>
         <file>res/moonlight.svg</file>
+        <file>res/moonlight-xr.png</file>
         <file>res/update.svg</file>
         <file>res/baseline-help_outline-24px.svg</file>
         <file>res/baseline-error_outline-24px.svg</file>
